      "name": "Where is Bricks & Milestones Solcrest located?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Bricks & Milestones Solcrest is located in Bileshivale, Hennur Road, North Bengaluru, Karnataka. The project offers convenient connectivity to Hennur Main Road, Outer Ring Road, Kalyan Nagar, KR Puram, Manyata Business Park and other key destinations."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Who is the developer of Bricks & Milestones Solcrest?",
